      "hizbQuarter": 91,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1530,
      "text": "But if you turn away, I have conveyed to you what I have been sent with. My Lord will replace you with other people, and you cannot harm Him in the least. My Lord watches over all things[29].”",
