      "page": 228,
      "ruku": 187,
      "hizbQuarter": 91,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1533,
      "text": "They were overtaken by a curse in this world and again on the Day of Resurrection. Indeed, ‘Ād denied their Lord; so away with ‘Ād, the people of Hūd!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
